  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting countries on climate resilient and sustainable health systems diagnostics and planning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This component will support focal countries (selected transparently using a range of criteria as a separate exercise) to assess health systems vulnerability, develop/strengthen evidence-based of what works in practice, and prepare integrated, multi-sectoral adaptation and mitigation plans.</narrative>
  </description>
